<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>poster boy</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">2hollis</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">2</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0Gz4Q1Bmyef5yA0G6LIIQZ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.730" end="00:39.780">Trash the ploy, turn myself to a poster boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.780" end="00:43.720">L-l-live by the sword, make myself turn two to four</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.720" end="00:48.160">I-I-I know you want it, oh-oh, you fucking got it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.160" end="00:50.890">Running away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.890" end="00:54.040">I-I-I-I'm running 'round, push it down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.040" end="00:55.690">Fuck, you think we going out?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.690" end="00:57.850">You so wrong, you so dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.850" end="00:59.870">We take our time, we don't rush</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.870" end="01:05.020">Y-y-y-y-you drive me, drive me, drive me crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.020" end="01:10.790">I wanted to call you my baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.790" end="01:18.790" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.880" end="01:30.880">T-t-t-t-trash the ploy, turn myself to a poster boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.880" end="01:35.190">L-l-live by the sword, make myself turn two to four</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.190" end="01:39.810">I-I-I-I know you want it, oh-oh, you fucking got it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.810" end="01:43.600">Running away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.600" end="01:47.600" /></div></body></tt>